The test suite included with Python’s library, [Lib/test/test\_generators.py](https://github.com/python/cpython/tree/3.8/Lib/test/test_generators.py), contains a number of more interesting examples. Here’s one generator that implements an in-order traversal of a tree using generators recursively.

```python
# A recursive generator that generates Tree leaves in in-order.
def inorder(t):
    if t:
        for x in inorder(t.left):
            yield x

        yield t.label

        for x in inorder(t.right):
            yield x
